WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.480 --> 00:00:04.880
"Yellowstone" fans get to step into the&nbsp;
Dutton family past with Taylor Sheridan's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:11.600
hotly-anticipated prequel series "1883," which&nbsp;
debuted on December 19th. "1883" presents a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:16.800
whole new story surrounding the ancestors of Kevin&nbsp;
Costner's John Dutton from "Yellowstone," as they&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:22.400
leave Texas to find a new life in Montana, only&nbsp;
to face extreme hardship on the journey there.

00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:26.960
"You got all these folks haulin' ass&nbsp;
West and North, and they've never&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:26.960 --> 00:00:29.920
even seen the country and they don't&nbsp;
even know if it's worth the journey."

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:34.880
"1883" is the origin story of "Yellowstone,"&nbsp;
including how the Dutton family acquired the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.880 --> 00:00:39.200
largest cattle ranch in the United States.&nbsp;
It's a tale that follows the 19th-century&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:43.440
Duttons as they travel west on a wagon train&nbsp;
through harsh environmental conditions,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.720
encountering hostile enemies at every turn.

00:00:46.720 --> 00:00:51.040
It has not been confirmed how many episodes&nbsp;
the first season of "1883" will have,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:51.040 --> 00:00:56.640
but it will likely be around 10, similar to&nbsp;
seasons of "Yellowstone." If "Yellowstone's"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.640 --> 00:01:03.280
record-breaking ratings are anything to go&nbsp;
by, then "1883" is going to be a huge success.

00:01:03.280 --> 00:01:06.480
While the show is sure to be a hit&nbsp;
with viewers, it's what happened&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.480 --> 00:01:11.040
behind the scenes — specifically with&nbsp;
lead star Tim McGraw — while making this&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:15.520
Western series that was truly entertaining,&nbsp;
according to his castmate, LaMonica Garrett.

00:01:15.520 --> 00:01:20.320
Shot on location in Texas and Montana, Garrett&nbsp;
reveals in a new interview that McGraw's antics&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:20.320 --> 00:01:25.840
on the set of "1883" made things extra interesting&nbsp;
between takes. The three-time Grammy winner plays&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:29.840
James Dutton, the great-grandfather&nbsp;
of Costner's "Yellowstone" character.

00:01:29.840 --> 00:01:33.840
Previews show McGraw going toe-to-toe&nbsp;
with Western gunslingers alongside Oscar&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:33.840 --> 00:01:38.240
nominee Sam Elliott and Garrett, who is&nbsp;
playing a character named Thomas. So,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:43.280
what was McGraw up to behind the scenes&nbsp;
that got such a kick out of the cast?

00:01:43.280 --> 00:01:47.760
It doesn't take a rocket scientist to figure&nbsp;
out that Tim McGraw would likely do a little&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:52.480
crooning while on the set of "1883," but&nbsp;
what co-star LaMonica Garrett didn't expect&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:52.480 --> 00:01:55.760
was for the country legend to&nbsp;
sing about every little thing&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:55.760 --> 00:02:00.880
under the sun — and on a constant basis,&nbsp;
to boot. Garrett told People magazine,

00:02:00.880 --> 00:02:06.480
"On set, Tim sings every day. Every&nbsp;
day, like in between takes, he's just,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:06.480 --> 00:02:10.880
he's humming. He's doing&nbsp;
something. He sings all the time."

00:02:10.880 --> 00:02:14.880
According to McGraw's co-star, it didn't matter&nbsp;
what he was doing or what kind of weather it was,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:14.880 --> 00:02:20.000
the star of the "Yellowstone" prequel series was&nbsp;
going to get his notes out. Garrett continued,

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:24.240
"He'll sing, 'The horse is angry&nbsp;
today' in a jingle. [...] You know,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.240 --> 00:02:30.480
he's a singer and that's what singers do. They&nbsp;
sing about their own stuff and everything else."

00:02:30.480 --> 00:02:34.880
The upcoming prequel series takes place in&nbsp;
an even more wild setting than "Yellowstone,"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:39.280
with the stronger "Wild West" feel&nbsp;
adding difficulty to the filming process.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:39.280 --> 00:02:42.880
In fact, Sam Elliott told Entertainment&nbsp;
Weekly that the first month of filming,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:47.600
which took place in Texas, was&nbsp;
"brutal" and frequently "100 degrees."

00:02:48.160 --> 00:02:49.360
Garret told People,

00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:55.280
"This is [filmed] outdoors 98 percent of the&nbsp;
time, where it'll be a hundred degrees and humid,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:55.280 --> 00:02:59.600
or you're in Montana and it's 15&nbsp;
degrees or 20 degrees and it's just&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:59.600 --> 00:03:01.680
freezing from sun up to sun down."

00:03:01.680 --> 00:03:06.320
Add to that constant dust and sweat, and you'd&nbsp;
likely welcome some entertainment to take your&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.320 --> 00:03:11.520
mind off of the intense work. So why not listen&nbsp;
to a Grammy-winning artist like Tim McGraw?

00:03:11.520 --> 00:03:16.640
Also starring in "1883" is McGraw's wife and&nbsp;
five-time Grammy-winning singer Faith Hill,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:16.640 --> 00:03:21.040
who plays Margaret Dutton, the strong-willed&nbsp;
matriarch of the Dutton family and McGraw's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:25.520
character's wife. Although there are no reports&nbsp;
of Hill joining in with her husband's humming&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.520 --> 00:03:29.600
and singing, that would definitely be&nbsp;
quite the gift for the cast and crew.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:35.760
The couple has been married since October of&nbsp;
1996, making this year their 25th anniversary.

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:42.240
McGraw and Hill have worked on music together&nbsp;
and toured many times in the past, but "1883"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:42.240 --> 00:03:47.520
will be their first official acting project&nbsp;
together. Taking on this classic story of a family&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:47.520 --> 00:03:53.360
protecting themselves and their possessions from&nbsp;
the dangerous world of the late 1800s in America,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:59.200
many people are excited to see the entire&nbsp;
cast of "1883" bring the rich story to life.

00:03:59.200 --> 00:04:03.680
The first episode of "1883" is&nbsp;
set to debut on December 19.

